  "text": "In March 2025 we converged first on the address. Forty-seven of us said \"address to congress,\" forty said \"joint address to congress,\" and thirty-seven said \"trump's joint address,\" all peaking on the same day, 2025-03-04. Twenty-nine of us reached for \"joint session of congress\" on that date. Gwen Moore was the first of us to say \"address to congress,\" years earlier; Bernard Sanders the first for \"joint address to congress.\"\n\nThen the record moved. By 2025-03-11, twenty-nine of us had said \"trump and elon.\" By 2025-03-20, thirty-five said \"executive order to\" and thirty-two said \"students with disabilities,\" peaking together on the same day.\n\nWe record that our largest agreement this month was the occasion itself, and that our attention then divided along two later dates. That is what the record shows.",
